    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together After Dark is a 4-player co-op horror experience that will take you on chilling journey into the unknown together with your friends. Dive deep into a dark and dangerous forest filled with unsettling mysteries, malevolent energies.<br><br>Immerse yourselves in the chilling atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.poster.avif?t=1737334097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.webm?t=1737334097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.mp4?t=1737334097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Walk through treacherous paths all covered in darkness and every rustle of the leaves or snap of a twig will feed your fear.<br>Witness spooky paranormal events that will make you doubt your mind.<br>Enjoy the excitement of camaraderie as you depend on one another to prevail over what lies ahead in terms of challenges and horrors.<br><br><br>Beyond the haunting atmosphere and chilling encounters lies a crucial task: It is necessary to find a way out without being seen.<br><br>Together After Dark provides a memorable tour of horror enthusiasts who are looking for an exciting and bloody journey with their friends.<br><br>Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player co-op horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntingly beautiful and atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling paranormal encounters and jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the dark secrets hidden within the forest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face the darkness?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together After Dark is a 4-player co-op horror experience that will take you on chilling journey into the unknown together with your friends. Dive deep into a dark and dangerous forest filled with unsettling mysteries, malevolent energies.<br><br>Immerse yourselves in the chilling atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.poster.avif?t=1737334097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.webm?t=1737334097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.mp4?t=1737334097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Walk through treacherous paths all covered in darkness and every rustle of the leaves or snap of a twig will feed your fear.<br>Witness spooky paranormal events that will make you doubt your mind.<br>Enjoy the excitement of camaraderie as you depend on one another to prevail over what lies ahead in terms of challenges and horrors.<br><br><br>Beyond the haunting atmosphere and chilling encounters lies a crucial task: It is necessary to find a way out without being seen.<br><br>Together After Dark provides a memorable tour of horror enthusiasts who are looking for an exciting and bloody journey with their friends.<br><br>Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player co-op horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntingly beautiful and atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling paranormal encounters and jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the dark secrets hidden within the forest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face the darkness?</p>",
